      'Few actors represent this transformation better than Anu K Aniyan.',
      "Unlike many public figures whose careers were built around glamour or celebrity culture, Anu's success has always felt remarkably understated. He didn't become popular because he projected a larger-than-life image. He became popular because he seemed like someone audiences already knew. His performances felt natural, his humour effortless, and his characters looked like people who could easily exist in any neighbourhood in Kerala.",
