      'Whether playing the hilariously relatable "Lolan" in the breakthrough series Thera Para or a stressed-out character in Kalakkachi, his characters spoke like ordinary Malayalis, reacted naturally to everyday situations, and found humour in life\'s smallest moments. That style quickly became one of the platform\'s biggest strengths.',
      'The Power of Relatability',
      'Entertainment has changed because audiences have changed. For decades, celebrities were expected to appear extraordinary. Their lives were distant, carefully managed, and intentionally aspirational.',
