      'From Digital Screens to Cinema Infrastructure',
      'For many years, creators from digital platforms were viewed by the traditional film industry as internet personalities rather than serious actors. That perception has completely transformed. Malayalam cinema has increasingly recognised that digital creators bring more than just followers, they bring audiences that already understand and appreciate their acting language.',
