      'The ultimate evolution of this crossover is the changing landscape of media production itself. Karikku did not just provide actors to cinema; the collective launched Karikku Studios, moving permanently into mainstream feature film production. With their debut feature film officially kicking off production on location in Munnar, starring the core original cast including Anu, the boundary between internet stardom and theatrical cinema has officially evaporated.',
